# React UI — Lib vs Lokal

## Prioritas import

```tsx
// ✅ Lib dulu
import { Button, Typography, Modal, Dropdown, Select, KnittoTable, Pagination, useToast, useOverlayState } from '@knittotextile/react-ui';

// ✅ Lokal hanya jika belum di lib
import InputWithLabel from '@/components/ui/inputs/input-with-label';
import { FormWrapper } from '@/components/ui/form/form';
```

## Bootstrap app

```tsx
// src/main.tsx
<KnittoProvider defaultTheme={readStoredTheme() ?? 'system'} toast={{ position: 'top-right', duration: 3000 }}>
  <Provider store={store}><App /></Provider>
</KnittoProvider>
```

```css
/* src/styles/main.css */
@import 'tailwindcss';
@import '@knittotextile/react-ui/styles';
```

## Komponen dari lib (jangan buat ulang lokal)

Button, Typography, Select, DatePicker, DateTimePicker, DateRangePicker, MonthYearPicker, Pagination, KnittoTable, BigCalendar, Modal, Dropdown, Radio, RadioGroup, Toast/useToast, KnittoProvider, ThemeToggle, useOverlayState

## Masih lokal di template

`src/components/ui/inputs/*`, `form/*`, `icon/*`, `card`, `container/*`, `portal` — plus `src/components/layout/`

## Pola halaman demo komponen

```tsx
<div className="p-4 flex flex-col gap-3 mb-10">
  <Typography as="h3">Judul</Typography>
  <div className="h-2 w-72 bg-burnt-orange-100" />
  <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">{/* cards */}</div>
</div>
```

## Modal & Dropdown

```tsx
const modal = useOverlayState();
<Modal isOpen={modal.isOpen} onOpenChange={modal.setOpen}>
  <Modal.Backdrop><Modal.Container size="md">...</Modal.Container></Modal.Backdrop>
</Modal>
```
